      "assumption": "PSCI SYSTEM_OFF terminates the complete VM independent of optional topology configuration",
      "basis": "Existing native system-off handler and shared Power.shutdown checkpoint invariant",
      "dependent_result": "One authoritative fallback VM terminal flag",
